#: src/constants/systems.ts
msgid "{0} Monterey ou plus récent, sur un Mac Apple Silicon"
msgstr "{0} Monterey or newer, on an Apple Silicon Mac"

#. placeholder {0}: SYSTEM_VERSIONS.windows
