msgid "Suivez l’installation jusqu’au bout."
msgstr "Follow the installation through to the end."

#: src/constants/rivals.ts
msgid "Sur Mac"
msgstr "On Mac"

#: src/constants/systems.ts
msgid "Sur Mac ? Prendre le .dmg"
msgstr "On a Mac? Take the .dmg"

#: src/screens/download-screen.tsx
msgid "Sur Mac, le fichier s’ouvre sans avertissement, et votre système vous dit qui l’a construit. Aucun autre outil de multicompte Dofus Retro ne le fait."
msgstr "On a Mac the file opens with no warning, and your system tells you who built it. No other Dofus Retro multi-account tool does this."

#: src/constants/rivals.ts
msgid "Sur Windows"
msgstr "On Windows"

#: src/constants/systems.ts
msgid "Sur Windows ? Prendre le .exe"
msgstr "On Windows? Take the .exe"

#: src/constants/wording.ts
msgid "Tableau des runes"
msgstr "Rune table"

#: src/constants/bodies.ts
msgid "Tant que le disque est ouvert, rien ne s’allume derrière et aucun sort ne part."
msgstr "While the disc is open, nothing lights up behind it and no spell goes off."

